      "what_happened_en": "Samsung Electronics announced a full intelligent eyewear lineup for release in the U.S. and South Korea on Dec. 10, with pre-orders starting Nov. 12; the collection combines Samsung engineering with 30 designs from Gentle Monster and Warby Parker and offers hands-free assistance powered by Gemini.",
